One issue: does `node --test` in Node 18 discover `test/*.test.js`? Yes, default test runner searches test directory recursively for files matching patterns, in Node 18 with `node --test` it looks for test dir files. Node >=18: `node --test` searches cwd for test files (files named test.js, test-*.js, *.test.js, or under test/ directory). Should be fine.

